__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
package-lock.json
.bohemia_gates.lock
v/
records/character/rig/*.glb
# ANIMATION 10/23: the one-man roll RUN TWO's build-one writes and deletes (a batch building people leaves one mid-build)
records/character/rig/_roll_*.json
# the LOOK ruler's DINOv2 export: built and cached on the free runner, never committed (gates/twin_gate.py L0)
tools/models/

# the headless Aseprite build: built and cached on the free runner (or in a scratch folder), never committed (the EULA; gates/aseprite_pipe_gate.py P1)
tools/aseprite/bin/

# THE TOOLCHAIN (PLUMBER 10/19/26, row [the toolchain]): keys live in .env and never reach git
.env
.env.*

# THE UI KIT (UI 10/23/26, [the UI the Crashbox way]): the raw renders and the colour cache are regenerated by
# tools/bohemia_ui_crashbox_kit.py; only each piece's kit.json (its render settings, read by the gate) is kept
records/target/ui_crashbox_kit/**/*.png
records/target/ui_blood/**/*.png
records/target/ui_crashbox_kit/*.npy
banks/*.cells.ndjson

# RUN FIVE 11/6 (rule 383): the whole-town renders are regenerated by tools/bohemia_run5_the_town_drawn_whole_11_6_26.py; their JSON is the record
records/target/cook_town_screens/whole/**/*.png
# ARENA 2 (rule 426(f)): the pit board's full renders and paint maps, ~70 MB, rebuilt by tools/bohemia_arena_the_pit_board.py; what ships is slices/arena/pit/ and records/target/arena/board/vote/
records/target/arena/board/*.png

# CHARACTER 11/7 (rule 427(b), the nine enemies): the walk frames the pack reads and the look checks' renders are
# regenerated by tools/bohemia_character_the_nine_enemies.py (make | look); the stills, faces and fight sheets are committed
records/character/enemies_nine/
records/target/character/the_nine_enemies/look/

# COOK FIVE 11/10 (rule 443(g)): the rig's full renders of the freeway boards and the casino's carpet and stage (~30 MB), rebuilt by
# tools/bohemia_cook5_the_freeway_finished_11_10_26.py render <scene> and tools/bohemia_cook5_the_casino_floor_finished_11_10_26.py render;
# what ships is slices/fight_ground/freeway/ and slices/fight_ground/casino/, and the carpet's calibration json is kept
records/target/cook5_freeway/render/
records/target/cook5_casino/render/
# COOK FIVE 11/11: the rig's full renders of the tunnels' and the garage's sheets and pieces (~40 MB) and the plans' previews, rebuilt by
# tools/bohemia_cook5_the_tunnels_and_the_garage_finished_11_11_26.py render <scene> / plan <name>; the calibration json is kept
records/target/cook5_inside/render/
records/target/cook5_inside/plan_*.png
records/target/cook5_colour/try/
records/target/cook5_colour/before/
records/target/cook5_colour/ledger_try.json
